 {'idx': 10, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Survivor: David vs. Goliath Survivor: David vs. Goliath is the 37th season of the American CBS competitive reality television series "Survivor". The season features 20 new contestants divided into two tribes embodied by two biblical figures: "David", composed of ten underdogs who constantly have to overcome obstacles, and "Goliath", composed of ten overachievers who have used their advantages in life to excel in their fields. The season premiered on September 26, 2018, with an extended 90-minute episode, and concluded with a live season finale on December 19, 2018, where Nick Wilson was named the winner over Mike White and Angelina', 'title': 'Survivor: David vs. Goliath'}
