 {'idx': 4, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'University" has won two Editor\'s Choice awards from syndicated game review publications. In 2004, Electronic Arts announced that it was planning on releasing a new expansion pack in March 2005. Sinjin Bain, executive producer and Maxis vice president said "We are thrilled to open up a whole new stage of life for the Sims, allowing players to lead them through all the challenges of college and living the exciting university lifestyle of the dorms, parties and exams." "This title is also the first in a line of expansion packs that will address our players desires, further develop The Sims 2', 'title': 'The Sims 2: University'}
