 {'idx': 14, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'via Electronic Arts\'s online store in the US and as a retail version in the Asia Pacific region). "Happy Holiday Stuff" adds additional holiday themed content to the game, and was released on November 7, 2006. A revised edition of "The Sims 2: Holiday Edition" was released simultaneously with "Happy Holiday Stuff"; containing the original "The Sims 2" game and the "Happy Holiday Stuff" expansion in one bundle, similar to that of "The Sims 2: Holiday Edition" released in 2005. On October 24, 2006, EA announced a special mini version of this pack titled The Sims 2: Happy Holiday Mini', 'title': 'The Sims 2 Stuff packs'}
