[{'idx': 0, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'DVD on January 1, 2019. Night School (2018 film) Night School is a 2018 American comedy film directed by Malcolm D. Lee and starring Kevin Hart, Tiffany Haddish, Rob Riggle, Romany Malco, Taran Killam, Keith David, and Anne Winters. Hart also produces the film alongside Will Packer, as well as co-wrote the script. The story follows a group of adults who set out to earn their GEDs. The film was released in the United States by Universal Pictures on September 28, 2018, has grossed over $102 million worldwide and received mixed reviews from critics. In 2001, high school student Teddy', 'title': 'Night School (2018 film)'}
