 {'idx': 25, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Vitale. Various compendiums have also been published in Australia and the U.K. Fairy Realm Fairy Realm is a series of ten children\'s fantasy novels by Australian author Jennifer Rowe, writing under the pseudonyms Mary-Anne Dickinson, and Emily Rodda. Rowe is also the author of bestselling books of "Deltora Quest" and "Rowan of Rin" series. In the U.K. the series is published as "Fairy Charm". The series follows the adventures of Jessie, an unsuspecting girl, whose grandmother happens to be a fairy queen who ran away to the human world with her human husband, Robert Belairs. The series chronicles Jessie\'s travels', 'title': 'Fairy Realm'}
 {'idx': 26, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Fairy Realm Fairy Realm is a series of ten children\'s fantasy novels by Australian author Jennifer Rowe, writing under the pseudonyms Mary-Anne Dickinson, and Emily Rodda. Rowe is also the author of bestselling books of "Deltora Quest" and "Rowan of Rin" series. In the U.K. the series is published as "Fairy Charm". The series follows the adventures of Jessie, an unsuspecting girl, whose grandmother happens to be a fairy queen who ran away to the human world with her human husband, Robert Belairs. The series chronicles Jessie\'s travels to the magical world of the Fairy Realm. With each story, she', 'title': 'Fairy Realm'}
