 {'idx': 16, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'score for "House at the End of the Street" was awarded the ASCAP PRS Film Award in 2013. Theo Green Theo Green is an award-winning film composer and sound designer, known for his music for "The Gambler", "House at the End of the Street", and his Academy Award nominated sound design for Blade Runner 2049. Green was in the New College Choir as a chorister of New College School in Oxford and later studied at Abingdon School and the Courtauld Institute of Art, London. 2008\'s BAFTA and BIFA-winning "The Escapist" was Green\'s first feature, as sound designer and additional composer,', 'title': 'Theo Green'}
