 {'idx': 20, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Hall was announced on May 3, 2015, at Wrestling Dontaku 2015, where Bullet Club\'s Kenny Omega, having retained his IWGP Junior Heavyweight Championship against what he called "Japanese garbage" (Ryusuke Taguchi), "Mexican garbage" (Máscara Dorada) and "American garbage" (Alex Shelley), announced he would not enter the upcoming 2015 Best of the Super Juniors tournament, but would instead next defend his title against the winner of said tournament at Dominion 7.5 in Osaka-jo Hall. On June 7, Kushida defeated Kyle O\'Reilly in the finals to win the 2015 Best of the Super Juniors. The nex day, the title match between Omega', 'title': 'Dominion 7.5 in Osaka-jo Hall'}
