 {'idx': 3, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'here as well. The city of Ashbringer, also known as the Great Bellows and the Chorus of Ringing Anvils, is located in the dwarven realm of Nidavellir. "Svartalfheim" is a realm of chaotic neutral dark elves; the goddess Eilistraee dwells there. These dark elves are foes of the Ysgardian dwarves. "Brassberg," the realm of the draconic god Aasterinian, is found here as well. Ysgard is derived from the realm of Asgard in Norse mythology. Ysgard Ysgard is the Outer Plane of Chaotic Neutral / Chaotic Good alignment in the "Dungeons & Dragons" role-playing game. It is also called "Asgard", "Gladsheim"', 'title': 'Ysgard'}
