 {'idx': 8, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Ambergris (Bob\'s Burgers) "Ambergris" is the 18th episode of the fourth season of the American animated comedy series "Bob\'s Burgers", and the 63rd episode overall. Written by Scott Jacobson, the episode sees the Belcher children—Tina (Dan Mintz), Gene (Eugene Mirman), and Louise (Kristen Schaal)—discovering a lump of ambergris, which they decide to sell illegally with the assistance of former bank robber and family friend Mickey (guest voiced by Bill Hader) upon discovering its high monetary value. Meanwhile, Mr. Fischoeder (guest voiced by Kevin Kline) brings in his neurotic brother Felix (guest voiced by Zach Galifianakis) to help Bob (H. Jon', 'title': "Ambergris (Bob's Burgers)"}
