[{'idx': 0, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Resident Evil 7: Biohazard Resident Evil 7: Biohazard is a survival horror game developed and published by Capcom, released in January 2017 for Windows, PlayStation 4, and Xbox One, and in May 2018 for the Nintendo Switch in Japan. Diverging from the more action-oriented "Resident Evil 5" and "Resident Evil 6", "Resident Evil 7" returns to the franchise\'s survival horror roots, emphasizing exploration. The player controls Ethan Winters as he searches for his wife in a derelict plantation occupied by a cannibal family, solving puzzles and fighting enemies. It is the first main series game to use a first-person view.', 'title': 'Resident Evil 7: Biohazard'}
