 {'idx': 69, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Hubert the Teddy Bear: Winter Games Hubert the Teddy Bear: Winter Games is a sports party game developed by Teyon for the WiiWare. It is available in the WiiWare Shop for 500 Wii Points. "Hubert the Teddy Bear: Winter Games" is a party game offering 8 winter-related minigames including snowball fights and snowman building. Both single-player and multi-player modes are available - players can compete in the Olympiad mode for up to 16 players. The game provides 3 levels of difficulty: child, youngster and adult. Players can also customize their characters by choosing gender, giving names or changing clothes. "Hubert', 'title': 'Hubert the Teddy Bear: Winter Games'}
