 {'idx': 12, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'My World (Bee Gees song) "My World" is a 1972 single released by the Bee Gees. It was originally released as a non-album single on 14 January 1972 worldwide. but was later included on the compilation "Best of Bee Gees, Volume 2" in 1973. The flip side of the single was "On Time", a country rock number composed by Maurice Gibb. "My World" reached the Top 20 in both US and UK. "My World" was written in the backstage of ITV\'s "The Golden Shot" with some of the same musical ideas as "How Can You Mend a Broken Heart". Maurice', 'title': 'My World (Bee Gees song)'}
