 {'idx': 1, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'It Ain\'t My Fault (Brothers Osborne song) "It Ain\'t My Fault" is a song by American country music duo Brothers Osborne. The song was released in January 2017 as the duo\'s fifth single overall. Duo members John and T.J. Osborne co-wrote the song with Kennedy Kelley, and Lee Thomas Miller. The duo wrote the song with Lee Thomas Miller in mid-2015. The song is about "a guy who doggedly, humorously refuses to own up to his own actions", as reflected in the title line. Miller came up with the opening lines about "a chain of events leading to an affair"', 'title': "It Ain't My Fault (Brothers Osborne song)"}
