 {'idx': 10, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'No One (Alicia Keys song) "No One" is a song by American singer and songwriter Alicia Keys from her third studio album, "As I Am" (2007). It was written and produced by Keys, Kerry Brothers Jr., and DJ Dirty Harry, and released as the album\'s lead single on September 11, 2007. The song topped the "Billboard" Hot 100 for five consecutive weeks and the Hot R&B/Hip-Hop Songs chart for 10 consecutive weeks, while charting inside the top 10 in most major markets. "No One" was the most listened-to song on US radio of 2008, with 3.08 billion listeners. It is', 'title': 'No One (Alicia Keys song)'}
