 {'idx': 1, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': '"Bubble Guppies: Get Ready for School". Season 4 of Bubble Guppies premiered on May 21, 2015. On November 15, 2016, Nickelodeon announced the series would not be renewed for a fifth season. Bubble Guppies Bubble Guppies is a children\'s television series produced for Nickelodeon and created by Jonny Belt and Robert Scull. The series is a combination sketch comedy, educational, and musical show revolving around the underwater adventures of a group of merperson preschoolers named Gil, Molly, Deema, Goby, Oona, and Nonny and their pets. The program premiered on Nickelodeon on January 24, 2011 and ended on October 21, 2016.', 'title': 'Bubble Guppies'}
